WEBVTT

NOTE
End of Disc 1. Edea conjures an ice javelin and impales Squall on the parade float. Rinoa reaches for him in horror. Squall's eye closes as consciousness fades.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Edea stands before her golden throne. Ice magic crackles to life at her feet.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Blue energy swirls around her. A jagged ice javelin takes shape above her headdress.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:22.000
The Gateway arch looms in the night. Edea raises her hand, eyes narrowing.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Edea gazes down with cold contempt. Her amber eyes show no mercy.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:38.000
The ice javelin strikes Squall. He staggers, impaled, the lance glowing through him.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:44.000
Rinoa reaches desperately over the edge, hand outstretched toward falling Squall.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Extreme close-up of Squall's eye reflecting fire. The eye slowly closes.
